      "originalText": "Plugins are\npieces of software\nstarted by OH\nand exposing a standard\nAPI interface:\n- bootstrap -> returns [namespace, permission-list, route-list, i18n-label-list]\n- invoke(method, route, params, body)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
